{
  "description": "SyMS reads and writes lake database properties in PascalCase, like its DDL responses (`00-pascal-case-ddl-response.json`): `{\"Source\":{\"Provider\":\"ADLS\",\"Location\":\"abfss://...\",\"Properties\":{...}},\"Properties\":{},\"PublishStatus\":\"PUBLISHED\"}`. The spec declares camelCase members, so `PutDatabase` sent keys SyMS ignores and the required `Source` was missing. Map `DatabaseProperties`, its request form `DatabasePropertiesInput`, and `DataSource` to their PascalCase wire names.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.azure.synapse_data#DatabaseProperties/members/originObjectId/traits/smithy.api#jsonName",
      "value": "OriginObjectId"
    },
